// sanitaryDoorSpan: a door moves DoorSeconds — real seconds for the hero, the same in game seconds for a person of the
// Life at the calendar rate his visit ran at (sanitaryDoorAlong).
func sanitaryDoorSpan(d medicalDoor, seconds float64) bool {
